Package: bambustudio
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://github.com/bambulab/BambuStudio
Source: bambustudio
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-libav
Description: Slicing software for Bambu Lab 3D printers
 Bambu Studio is a cutting-edge, feature-rich slicing application based on
 PrusaSlicer. It provides project-based workflows, systematically optimized
 slicing algorithms, an easy-to-use graphical interface, multiple plates,
 hybrid/tree supports, multi-material printing and remote printer control.
 .
 Printing through an SD card works out of the box. The optional non-free
 Bambu networking plugin is not included in this package.
